---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Emergency Plumber Aintree | 30min Response | From £80"
  description="Emergency plumber in Aintree L9 and L10. 15 to 20 minute response from our Kirkby base. Covers Aintree Lane, Sefton Drive, Ormskirk Road, the racecourse area and Aintree University Hospital surrounds. Sefton Council area. From £80 an hour."
>

  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "Emergency Plumber Aintree",
    "alternateName": ["24 Hour Plumber Aintree", "Aintree Emergency Plumber L9 L10"],
    "serviceType": "Emergency Plumbing",
    "description": "Emergency plumber in Aintree L9 and L10. We cover Aintree Lane, Sefton Drive, Ormskirk Road, Church Avenue, the racecourse area and the Aintree University Hospital surrounds. 15 to 20 minute response from our Kirkby base. Gas Safe registered. From £80 an hour.",
    "provider": { "@id": "https://liverpoolemergencyplumber.co.uk/#business" },
    "areaServed": [
      { "@type": "Place", "name": "Aintree, L9" },
      { "@type": "Place", "name": "Aintree, L10" },
      { "@type": "Place", "name": "Aintree Racecourse" },
      { "@type": "Place", "name": "Old Roan" },
      { "@type": "Place", "name": "Ormskirk Road" },
      { "@type": "Place", "name": "Sefton Drive" },
      { "@type": "Place", "name": "Aintree University Hospital" }
    ],
    "hoursAvailable": { "@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "dayOfWeek": ["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"], "opens": "00:00", "closes": "23:59" },
    "offers": [
      { "@type": "Offer", "name": "Weekday Emergency Plumber Aintree", "price": "80", "priceCurrency": "GBP", "description": "Monday to Friday 9am to 5pm. 1 hour minimum charge." },
      { "@type": "Offer", "name": "Weekend Emergency Plumber Aintree", "price": "120", "priceCurrency": "GBP", "description": "Saturday and Sunday 9am to 1pm. 1 hour minimum charge." },
      { "@type": "Offer", "name": "Out of Hours Emergency Plumber Aintree", "price": "150", "priceCurrency": "GBP", "description": "Nights, bank holidays and out of hours. 24/7 availability." }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much does an emergency plumber cost in Aintree?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "£80 an hour weekdays 9am to 5pm. £120 an hour weekends 9am to 1pm. £150 an hour out of hours, nights and bank holidays. 1 hour minimum on every call-out. Parts at cost. Most jobs cost £80 to £350. Written quote before work starts. No call-out fee." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How quickly can you reach Aintree?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "We're based in Kirkby. Aintree is a 10 to 15 minute run via the A580 East Lancashire Road. Most calls reach us inside 20 minutes from first contact. A real person picks up the phone any time of day or night." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you work in Sefton or just Liverpool Council areas?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Both. Aintree is in Sefton Borough Council, not Liverpool City Council. Our cover crosses both councils. We work the same fixed rates either side of the boundary. CP12 paperwork meets the standard for Sefton landlords." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you cover the area around Aintree University Hospital?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The streets around Aintree University Hospital have a strong NHS staff rental base. We cover landlord call-outs and tenant emergencies 24/7. Written reports for landlord insurance claims as standard." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "What about Grand National week?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Grand National week in April brings thousands of visitors to Aintree. Cold spring nights catch out pipework that wasn't lagged through winter. We attend burst pipe emergencies the same as any other time. Same fixed rates. No race-week premium." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you work on retirement living apartments?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Aintree has a strong over-55 demographic and a number of retirement living schemes including Sefton House on Church Avenue. We coordinate with site managers where access is needed to shared services. We treat older customers with care and we explain things plainly." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Are your engineers Gas Safe registered?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. All gas work is done by our own Gas Safe engineers. Check our entry at gassaferegister.co.uk. It's against the law to work on gas without it." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you guarantee your work?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Every job has a 12-month workmanship guarantee. If something we fixed fails because of our work, we come back. No charge." } }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://liverpoolemergencyplumber.co.uk" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Emergency Plumber Aintree", "item": "https://liverpoolemergencyplumber.co.uk/emergency-plumber-aintree" }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="page-hero-badge" style="margin:0 auto 1rem;">
        <span class="live-dot"></span>
        Available 24/7 in Aintree L9 and L10
      </div>
      <h1>Emergency Plumber in Aintree</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">24/7 emergency plumber covering Aintree Lane, Sefton Drive, Ormskirk Road, Church Avenue, the racecourse area and the streets around Aintree University Hospital. 15 to 20 minute run from our Kirkby base. £80 an hour fixed. Gas Safe registered.</p>

      <div style="background:var(--navy);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1rem 1.5rem;max-width:320px;margin:1.25rem auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;">
        <span style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:3rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--orange);line-height:1;">15<small style="font-size:1.4rem;color:#ffffff;">min</small></span>
        <span style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.2;">Response from our Kirkby base</span>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-size:0.85rem;margin:0.3rem 0 0;">From <strong style="color:var(--orange);">£80/hour</strong> · 1 hour minimum · Fixed rates</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.6rem;max-width:320px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;">
        <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-orange btn-lg btn-full" style="box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(249,115,22,0.4);font-size:1.3rem;color:#ffffff;">CALL 0151 558 0334</a>
        <a href="/get-started" class="btn btn-lg btn-full" style="background:var(--navy);color:#ffffff;border:2px solid var(--navy);">BOOK ONLINE</a>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <span style="background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:0.45rem 1rem;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);">✓ Gas Safe Registered</span>
        <span style="background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:0.45rem 1rem;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);">✓ L9/L10 Local Cover</span>
        <span style="background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:0.45rem 1rem;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);">✓ 12-Month Guarantee</span>
        <span style="background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:0.45rem 1rem;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);">✓ Fixed Rates from £80</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="pf">

  <!-- REVIEW TRUST BAR -->
  <section style="background:#1a3a5c;padding:1.25rem 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.6rem;text-align:center;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.6rem;">
          <div style="color:#f59e0b;font-size:1.1rem;">★★★★★</div>
          <div style="color:#ffffff;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:700;">5.0 · 3 Google Reviews</div>
        </div>
        <div style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-size:0.84rem;font-style:italic;max-width:520px;">"Great company, came within 30 mins for emergency burst pipe, couldn't praise them enough!" James Alexander</div>
        <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=Liverpool+Emergency+Plumber+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="background:#f97316;color:#ffffff;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border:none;padding:0.4rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;">See our Google reviews →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- PROPERTY TYPES -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="pf-section-label">AINTREE HOMES WE COVER</span>
      <h2>One Plumber. Every Type of Aintree Home.</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Aintree is 94% semi-detached. Most stock is post-war, with newer pockets and some Victorian streets near the station. Here's what we usually find.</p>
      <div class="pf-why-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>1950s and 1960s Post-War Semis</h3>
          <p>The bulk of Aintree stock. Three-bed family semis on streets like Sefton Drive, Aintree Lane and the roads off Ormskirk Road. Original plumbing was copper. Heating systems have been replaced two or three times since. We carry common parts on the van.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>1970s and 1980s Private Estates</h3>
          <p>Newer pockets across L10. Copper pipework with compression fittings, now 40 to 50 years old. The joints can start to weep as the seals harden. Same-visit fix in most cases.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Victorian Terraces Near the Racecourse</h3>
          <p>The streets close to Aintree station and the L9 borders have older Victorian terraces. Lead supply pipes, cast iron waste, 130 years of part-upgrades. We work on them every week.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Retirement Living Apartments</h3>
          <p>Aintree has a strong over-55 demographic. Schemes like Sefton House on Church Avenue. Shared communal services, on-site managers, mains pressure systems. We coordinate access where needed and we treat older customers with care.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Aintree Hospital Area Rentals</h3>
          <p>The streets around Aintree University Hospital have a strong NHS staff rental base. We cover landlord call-outs and tenant emergencies 24/7. Written reports for insurance claims as standard.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Modern Infill New Builds</h3>
          <p>The newer plots across L9 and L10. Modern combi boilers, push-fit plumbing, often still under maker warranty. We honour warranty terms when we work.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- PRICING -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Emergency Plumber Aintree. Fixed Rates. No Surprises.</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Written quote before work starts. 1 hour minimum on every call-out. Parts at cost. The price we quote is the price you pay.</p>

      <div class="pf-pricing-grid">
        <div class="pf-price-card">
          <div class="pf-price-tier">WEEKDAY</div>
          <div class="pf-price-name">Monday to Friday</div>
          <div class="pf-price-sub">9am to 5pm</div>
          <div class="pf-price-amount">£80<small>/hr</small></div>
          <ul class="pf-price-list">
            <li>15 min response from Kirkby</li>
            <li>Gas Safe engineer</li>
            <li>1 hour minimum</li>
            <li>Parts at cost</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-navy btn-full">Call Now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-price-card">
          <div class="pf-price-tier">WEEKEND</div>
          <div class="pf-price-name">Saturday to Sunday</div>
          <div class="pf-price-sub">9am to 1pm</div>
          <div class="pf-price-amount">£120<small>/hr</small></div>
          <ul class="pf-price-list">
            <li>Same fast service</li>
            <li>Gas Safe engineer</li>
            <li>1 hour minimum</li>
            <li>Parts at cost</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-navy btn-full">Call Now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-price-card pf-price-card-featured">
          <div class="pf-price-badge">24/7</div>
          <div class="pf-price-tier">OUT OF HOURS</div>
          <div class="pf-price-name">Nights and Holidays</div>
          <div class="pf-price-sub">Always available</div>
          <div class="pf-price-amount">£150<small>/hr</small></div>
          <ul class="pf-price-list">
            <li>Real person answers now</li>
            <li>Priority response</li>
            <li>Gas Safe engineer</li>
            <li>1 hour minimum</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-orange btn-full" style="color:#ffffff;">Call Now. We Answer.</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pf-alert" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <strong>No Grand National week premium</strong>
        <p>Race week in April. Cold snaps catch out pipework. We attend at the same fixed rates. The <a href="https://www.checkatrade.com/blog/cost-guides/plumber-call-out-fee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Checkatrade typical price for emergency plumber call-outs</a> in Liverpool runs £80 to £180 an hour. We sit at the bottom end. No call-out fee.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- LOCAL KNOWLEDGE SECTION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="pf-section-label">AINTREE LOCAL KNOWLEDGE</span>
      <h2>Aintree Sits in Both Sefton and Liverpool</h2>

      <div class="pf-card pf-card-left-orange" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <p>Aintree is split across two postcodes. L10 is the larger residential side, in Sefton Borough Council. L9 covers the streets closer to the racecourse, also mostly Sefton but with some Liverpool City borders.</p>

        <p>The council split matters for landlords. Sefton has its own paperwork standard. Liverpool has selective licensing in 16 wards but those don't reach Aintree. We do CP12 paperwork to the standard each council expects.</p>

        <p>94% of Aintree property sales are semi-detached homes. The average L10 home sits around £195,000. The top end on Aintree Lane reaches £320,000. Most owners are long-term residents.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pf-card pf-card-left-orange" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <p>The local landmarks define the area. Aintree Racecourse hosts the Grand National every April. Aintree University Hospital is the major NHS site for north Liverpool, with thousands of staff. Old Roan station and Aintree station are on the Northern Line.</p>

        <p>Aintree has a strong over-55 demographic. Schemes like Sefton House on Church Avenue offer retirement living for the local community. We handle the plumbing for those schemes and for the wider family-home base across L9 and L10.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- COMMON JOBS -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Common Emergency Jobs in Aintree</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">What we attend most often in L9 and L10.</p>
      <div class="jobs-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">

        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Compression Joint Weeping</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>Compression fittings in 1970s and 1980s Aintree homes are now 40 to 50 years old. The olive inside the joint hardens. The seal weeps and then fails. We cut out the old fitting and put in a new one. Under an hour in most cases.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>System Boiler Pump and Valve Faults</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>Older Aintree semis with system boilers and a hot water cylinder. Pumps fail. Three-port valves stick. The cylinder thermostat dies. We carry common spares on the van. Same-visit fix in most cases.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Grand National Week Burst Pipes</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>April brings the Grand National and the last cold spring nights. Pipework that wasn't lagged through winter often bursts in those final cold spells. We attend Aintree burst pipe calls 24/7. We can lag the pipes on the same visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Hospital Area Rental Emergencies</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>NHS staff rentals near Aintree University Hospital need fast turnarounds. A tenant without hot water before a 12-hour shift is a priority. We attend and provide written reports for landlord and insurance use.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Retirement Apartment Calls</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>Sefton House and other retirement schemes need clear, gentle service. We coordinate with site managers, explain things plainly, and don't leave a mess. Same fixed rates as any other home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Victorian Terrace Leaks</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>The older terraces near the racecourse and L9 borders have lead supply pipes and cast iron waste runs that fail without warning. We carry copper and plastic replacement pipework. Most jobs we fix on the same visit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- WHAT TO DO SECTION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>While You Wait For Our Engineer</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Four steps to protect your home while we're on the way.</p>
      <div class="pf-who-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">1</span><div><strong>Find the stopcock and turn it off</strong><p>For any water leak, the stopcock is your first move. In most Aintree semis it's under the kitchen sink. In retirement apartments it's often in the airing cupboard. Turn it clockwise to stop all water.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">2</span><div><strong>If you smell gas, get out</strong><p>Don't touch any switches. Open windows as you leave. Call <a href="https://cadentgas.com/emergencies" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--orange);font-weight:700;">Cadent Gas on 0800 111 999</a> first. Then us on 0151 558 0334 once the home is safe.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">3</span><div><strong>No heating? Check the pressure gauge</strong><p>Look at the gauge on the boiler. It should sit between 1 and 1.5 bar. Below 0.5, you can top it up with the filling loop underneath. That fixes about half of all "no heating" calls. If it doesn't, call us.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">4</span><div><strong>Photograph the damage</strong><p>Take photos and video before you start cleaning. Insurance claims need proof. We give you our own fault report with photos as well, ready for your insurer.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- SERVICES SECTION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Other Plumbing and Heating Services in Aintree</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Not an emergency? We cover all plumbing and heating work across L9 and L10. Gas Safe registered. Fixed prices. Free surveys.</p>
      <div class="pf-related" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <a href="/boiler-service-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Boiler Service Aintree</strong><span>Annual boiler service from £120. Gas Safe engineer. Certificate same day. Keeps your warranty valid.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/boiler-installation-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Boiler Installation Aintree</strong><span>New boiler from £1,800 fully fitted. Worcester Bosch, Vaillant, Ideal. 10-year warranty. ECO4 grant check included.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/gas-safety-certificate-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>CP12 for Aintree Landlords</strong><span>CP12 paperwork from £80. Same-day if needed. Combined boiler service and CP12 from £175. Batch pricing for the Aintree University Hospital rental landlords.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/power-flushing-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Power Flushing Aintree</strong><span>Cold radiators or noisy boiler? Power flush from £350 for systems up to 10 radiators. Protects your new boiler warranty.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/radiators-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Radiator Repairs and Swaps</strong><span>New radiators from £200 supply and fit. TRV upgrades from £50. Common upgrade in Aintree's 1950s and 1970s semis.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/showers-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Shower Installation and Repairs</strong><span>Electric showers from £200 supply and fit. Shower mixer from £300. Walk-in shower fits suited to retirement-living refurbs.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- WHY CHOOSE -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Why Aintree Customers Choose Us</h2>
      <div class="pf-why-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>15 Minute Response from Kirkby</h3><p>We're based at 29 Park Road, Kirkby. Aintree is a 10 to 15 minute run via the A580. Most calls reach us inside 20 minutes from first contact.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>L9 and L10 Local Cover</h3><p>1950s semis, 1970s estates, Victorian terraces, retirement apartments, hospital-area rentals. We work on every type of Aintree stock at the same fixed rates.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Our Own Gas Safe Engineers</h3><p>Every engineer is our own staff. No sub-contractors. No agency workers. Check our entry at <a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gassaferegister.co.uk</a>.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Fixed Rates. No Surprises.</h3><p>£80 weekdays. £120 weekends. £150 out of hours. 1 hour minimum. Parts at cost. Written quote first.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Sefton and Liverpool Both Covered</h3><p>Aintree crosses two councils. We work either side at the same rates. CP12 paperwork meets the standard each council expects.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>12-Month Workmanship Guarantee</h3><p>Every repair carries a 12-month workmanship guarantee. If something we fixed fails because of our work, we come back. No charge.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- AUTHORITY LINKS / USEFUL INFORMATION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Useful Information for Aintree Residents</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">External resources for plumbing, heating, council and water emergencies.</p>
      <div style="background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.5rem;margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
          <li><a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--orange);font-weight:700;">Gas Safe Register</a>. Check any gas engineer working at your Aintree home.</li>
